  - Id: intro_panic
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Christ... what have I done? You! No... no, please, leave me be!
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Come on, what's up? Caught with the intern again?
      NextNodeId: reveal_prompt
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: Suit yourself.
      NextNodeId: 
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: reveal_prompt
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Agh! I don't have time to care if you leak this to the press. You've
      probably noticed an uptick in... undesirable behaviour around here?
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: You mean the nitties losing their minds?
      NextNodeId: reveal_a
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: Can you just spit it out?
      NextNodeId: reveal_b
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: reveal_a
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: YES! Well, no... they're just misunderstood constituents. Anyway,
      I tried to calm them down. I asked ChatJeeves LLM, and three hours later I
      had a prototype calming vape. I was told it would pacify the oiks, but bloody
      hell old boy, they've gone completely feral!
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Right, and why are you telling me this?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_1
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: Sounds tasty. A toot for me perchance, old boy?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_2
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: reveal_b
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Right, fine. Had a consult with an AI assistant, whipped up a prototype
      chill-out vape, and tested it on a few local ruffians.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Right, and why are you telling me this?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_1
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: Sounds tasty. A toot for me perchance, old boy?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_2
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: ask_why_1
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: "I've spoken to Daniel Pauls \u2014 I know you've got magical capabilities.
      I'll report you to the Old Bill if you don't help me clean this up! Help me
      recover the prototype and there's a handsome sum in it for you. Please! *eyes
      begin to tear up*"
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Well, since you asked nicely... go on then.
      NextNodeId: end_accept
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: mosley_vape_quest_one
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: Bugger off.
      NextNodeId: end_decline
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: ask_why_2
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: They're bloody rabid, you fool! I'll tell you where they are, just
      fetch back that vape! If word gets out, it's Black Mamba 2.0 and this place
      becomes Manchester!
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Right, maybe not then. What exactly do you need done?
      NextNodeId: ask_why_1
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
    - ChoiceText: I'm out.
      NextNodeId: 
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
