      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_greet
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Ey up, lad! How are we doing? Have you spoken to Daniel Pauls?
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Mosley... where did you actually get those vapes from?
      NextNodeId: wm_made
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_made
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: I made them! I asked the AI engine, sourced the components myself.
      Why do you ask?
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Scrap Man saw you buying a crate of Chinese-stamped vapes from
        Ralph and Sanjeet.
      NextNodeId: wm_thing
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_thing
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: No... well, you see... the nuance of the situation is...
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Out with it, Mosley.
      NextNodeId: wm_toomuch
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_toomuch
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: It was just too much, old boy! The borough's going down the tubes,
      the Neeks were rioting, and I didn't know what else to do!
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Go on.
      NextNodeId: wm_experiment
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_experiment
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: I read online that overseas authorities use sedating vapours for
      crowd pacification. The council would never approve the budget, so I used my
      personal allowance! It was purely an off-the-books civic trial!
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: But Mosley, you bought them off street gangs. Why?
      NextNodeId: wm_korean
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_korean
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Well, they assured me it was high-grade Korean import! I questioned
      the labels, but Sanjeet told me not to be culturally insensitive. Who was I
      to argue?
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Sanjeet is from Birmingham, Mosley. He's not an East Asian import
        authority.
      NextNodeId: wm_same
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_same
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: Well, it's all rather exotic to me, isn't it? Bit of this, bit
      of that...
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: Right, let's stop before you dig a deeper hole. Where are Ralph
        and Sanjeet holing up?
      NextNodeId: wm_where
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: 
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: 
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
  - Id: wm_where
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: They operate out of a trap house near the abandoned bus station
      up north. That's where we concluded our transaction.
    Choices:
    - ChoiceText: I'll pay them a visit. Try to stay out of trouble, Councillor.
      NextNodeId: 
      QuestGate: 0
      QuestGateId: 
      QuestGateStage: 0
      RequiredStat: 
      RequiredStatLevel: 0
      RequiredItem: {fileID: 0}
      RequiredItemQuantity: 1
      ConsumeRequiredItem: 0
      GrantQuestId: gangbusters
      GrantQuestTitle: 
      GrantQuestObjective: 
      GrantQuestLocation: 
      TeachSpark: 0
      CompleteQuestId: wtf_mosley
      Merchant: {fileID: 0}
      MerchantAction: 0
      HireCompanionId: 
      HireCompanionFree: 0
      CompanionCommand: 0
